#sidebar("Design Notes")[
#strong[Roles.] Bellator (Sōma): Attack and Defend, forcing obstacles, intimidation. Furcifer (Mētis): Feint and Maneuver, infiltration, deception. Savant (Psychē): analysis, investigation, healing. Interlocutor (Pneuma): leads Arguments and Negotiations, contacts. Explorator (Sōma/Mētis): ranged Attacks, ambush, travel and tracking. Adept (Pneuma/Psychē): flexible by Domain. These are role targets, not Effect permissions.

#strong[Watch in playtest.] Power-cost discounts used with Effort for Power (Silver Tongue, Analyze, Field Medic, Deadly Precision, Jury-Rig in Generic Focuses). Adept workings: if they overshadow other playbooks, try a base working cost of 2, or limit Focused Channel to minor and significant workings. Vehicle signature items are 0 load because they don't come on foot missions; an absent vehicle gives no bonus.
]
